cleanfpv.gui.wizard.welcome.title=Welcome
cleanfpv.gui.wizard.welcome.text=Clean FPV turns you into a first-person-view racing drone. This short setup gets your controls ready. Is this your first flight?
cleanfpv.gui.wizard.welcome.new=I'm new - set me up
cleanfpv.gui.wizard.welcome.returning=I know my way around
cleanfpv.gui.wizard.welcome.returning.tooltip=Skips the setup and opens the settings. You can run the wizard again from there.
cleanfpv.gui.wizard.has_controller.title=Controller
cleanfpv.gui.wizard.has_controller.text=Do you want to fly with a radio transmitter or a gamepad? Without one you can still fly with keyboard and mouse.
cleanfpv.gui.wizard.has_controller.yes=Yes, I have one
cleanfpv.gui.wizard.has_controller.no=Keyboard and mouse
cleanfpv.gui.wizard.choose_controller.title=Choose Controller
cleanfpv.gui.wizard.choose_controller.text=Pick your controller from the list, then tell us what kind it is. Radios usually connect over USB in joystick mode.
cleanfpv.gui.wizard.choose.axes_buttons=%s axes, %s buttons
cleanfpv.gui.wizard.choose.none=No controller found yet. Plug it in (radios: select USB joystick mode) and it will show up here.
cleanfpv.gui.wizard.choose.radio=It's a radio
cleanfpv.gui.wizard.choose.radio.tooltip=A hobby RC transmitter with a non-centring throttle stick.
cleanfpv.gui.wizard.choose.gamepad=It's a gamepad
cleanfpv.gui.wizard.choose.gamepad.tooltip=A console-style controller with self-centring sticks.
cleanfpv.gui.wizard.choose.keyboard=Keyboard instead
cleanfpv.gui.wizard.center.title=Centre the Sticks
cleanfpv.gui.wizard.center.text=Let both sticks rest in the middle. On a radio, put the throttle stick in the middle too. Then press Next.
cleanfpv.gui.wizard.throttle.title=Throttle
cleanfpv.gui.wizard.throttle.text=Push the LEFT stick straight UP, then let it return to the middle.
cleanfpv.gui.wizard.yaw.title=Yaw
cleanfpv.gui.wizard.yaw.text=Push the LEFT stick to the RIGHT, then let it return to the middle.
cleanfpv.gui.wizard.pitch.title=Pitch
cleanfpv.gui.wizard.pitch.text=Push the RIGHT stick straight UP, then let it return to the middle.
cleanfpv.gui.wizard.roll.title=Roll
cleanfpv.gui.wizard.roll.text=Push the RIGHT stick to the RIGHT, then let it return to the middle.
cleanfpv.gui.wizard.stick.waiting=Waiting for movement...
cleanfpv.gui.wizard.stick.recenter=Found axis %s - now return the stick to the middle
cleanfpv.gui.wizard.range.title=Stick Range
cleanfpv.gui.wizard.range.text=Circle both sticks slowly around their outer edges a few times. This continues on its own once every stick has reached its limits.
cleanfpv.gui.wizard.range.skip.tooltip=Keep the current calibration.
cleanfpv.gui.wizard.verify.title=Check
cleanfpv.gui.wizard.verify.text=Move the sticks. The left box should follow your left stick and the right box your right stick, with up and right matching. Is it right?
cleanfpv.gui.wizard.verify.yes=Yes, it works
cleanfpv.gui.wizard.verify.retry=No, try again
cleanfpv.gui.wizard.arm_begin.title=Arm Switch
cleanfpv.gui.wizard.arm_begin.text=Choose the switch or button you want to arm the drone with. Put it in the OFF position now, then press Next.
cleanfpv.gui.wizard.arm_begin.skip=Use a key instead
cleanfpv.gui.wizard.arm_begin.skip.tooltip=Arm with the keyboard key only (it always works, even with a switch set up).
cleanfpv.gui.wizard.arm_flip.title=Arm Switch
cleanfpv.gui.wizard.arm_flip.text=Now flip that switch ON (or press the button).
cleanfpv.gui.wizard.arm_verify.title=Arm Switch
cleanfpv.gui.wizard.arm_verify.text=Flip the switch back and forth. It should read ARMED when ON. If it is the wrong way round, press "Reversed".
cleanfpv.gui.wizard.arm_verify.armed=ARMED
cleanfpv.gui.wizard.arm_verify.disarmed=DISARMED
cleanfpv.gui.wizard.arm_verify.backwards=Reversed
cleanfpv.gui.wizard.keyboard.title=Keyboard and Mouse
cleanfpv.gui.wizard.keyboard.text=W or Space adds throttle (with no key the drone holds half throttle), S cuts it, A and D yaw, and the mouse pitches and rolls. Pick your arm key and mouse gain below.
cleanfpv.gui.wizard.keyboard.arm_key=Arm key: %s
cleanfpv.gui.wizard.keyboard.press_key=Press a key... (Esc cancels)
cleanfpv.gui.wizard.complete.title=Ready
cleanfpv.gui.wizard.complete.text=All set. Everything can be fine-tuned later in the settings.
cleanfpv.gui.wizard.complete.arm_switch=Lower the throttle and flip your arm switch (or press %s) to take off.
cleanfpv.gui.wizard.complete.arm_key=Press %s to arm and take off.
cleanfpv.gui.wizard.complete.more=More Settings
cleanfpv.gui.wizard.complete.done=Let's Fly

